ddle value of the county&rsquo;s 5 grids June to July came in under 90% of normal in 36 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 28% of normal in January to February and 192% in June to July. Grid 25944 had its driest year in 1988 at 58% of normal. On grid 26243 the preliminary estimate for August to September 2026 sits at 201.7, which is not RMA&rsquo;s final index.</p>"}
